 {
  "verse_id": "tsa-a10-v18",
  "song": "tsa-a10",
  "verse": 18,
  "lines": [
   "One path, sixfold: mātṛviśrānti's triple",
   "distinction of world-tattva-kalā-path;",
   "likewise in its authority, padā-dhvā;",
   "in the authority's wave-subsiding, mantra-dhvā;",
   "in that subsiding, full-knowership, varṇā-dhvā —",
   "in such viśrānti own-nature is gained:",
   "thus the one's sixfoldness is warranted."
  ],
